sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as User
    participant APP as Mobile App
    participant OFS as OfflineExpenseService
    participant API as Backend API
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    U->>APP: Add expense
    APP->>OFS: createExpense(request)
    OFS->>OFS: check connectivity

    alt Online
      OFS->>API: POST /api/expenses
      API->>DB: Insert expense + splits
      DB-->>API: Success
      API-->>OFS: Created expense
      OFS-->>APP: Return success
      APP-->>U: Show expense added
    else Offline
      OFS->>OFS: Save locally
      OFS->>OFS: Queue sync operation
      OFS-->>APP: Return offline success
      APP-->>U: Saved offline, will sync later
    end
